 "remarks": "DARIEN LAND OPPORTUNITY. BUILD THE HOME OF YOUR DREAMS. Current house AS-IS. Rare land opportunity, AAA in town street, quiet neighborhood with not only privacy but YES public water and sewer. Deep lot with 1.41 acres per land Survey. Close to both Darien Train station and Noroton Heights Train Station for easy commute to NYC. Take full advantage of all the shops and restaurants of the New Darien Commons, Heights Crossing and the amazing new downtown Darien development (The Corbin District). Darien the envy of all the gold coast towns with beautiful beaches, parks and the acquisition of Great Island for future enjoyment. Not to mention Darien's Award-winning schools K-12!",
